msgid "Kota「managing......」"
msgstr "Kota「arreglármelas......」"

msgid "Kota「*Gasp* ......W-What the heck was that＿Japanese!? It came naturally to me......＿On top of that, for some reason I」"
msgstr "Kota「¡Ah! ......¡¿Q-Qué fue ese japonés?!＿Me salió solo...... Además, por＿algún motivo me」"

msgid "Kota「pictured the word in romaji......!?」"
msgstr "Kota「imaginé la palabra en romaji......!?」"

msgid "Kota「The dishes are finished in an instant......＿I'm interested in grocery store＿coupons...... Looking up at the sky, I」"
msgstr "Kota「Lavo los platos en un instante......＿Me interesan los cupones del＿supermercado...... Miro al cielo y」"

msgid "Kota「start to think \"I should air my futon\"＿and stuff......」"
msgstr "Kota「empiezo a pensar \"Debería airear＿mi futón\" y esas cosas......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Come to think of it, I stubbed my toe,＿the power went out in the middle of my＿bath, and it was nothing but red lights」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora que lo pienso, me golpeé un dedo＿del pie, se fue la luz mientras me＿bañaba y solo hubo semáforos en rojo」"

msgid "Ryuuji「all the way here...... Little bits of bad＿luck, I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「de camino aquí...... Mala suerte＿en pequeñas dosis, supongo.」"

msgid "Kota「......Hm? Come to think of it, I haven't＿met with that much misfortune! Which＿means...... it's like we really are each」"
msgstr "Kota「......¿Hm? Ahora que lo pienso, ¡no he＿tenido tanta mala suerte! Entonces......＿parece que de verdad somos el」"

msgid "Kota「other.」"
msgstr "Kota「otro.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... That girl from yesterday -＿Sakura-chan, was it? I was studying＿with her, late into the night, in a room I」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... La chica de ayer,＿Sakura-chan, ¿no? Estudiaba con ella＿hasta tarde en un cuarto que」"

msgid "Ryuuji「don't recognize.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「no reconozco.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, so then I remembered...... After＿that night, the next time she came to＿mind, I looked around everywhere for」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, entonces recordé...... Tras esa＿noche, cuando volví a pensar en ella,＿la busqué por todas partes」"

msgid "Ryuuji「her at school......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「en la escuela......」"

msgid "Kota「I was just lost in confusion, I guess......＿Uh, err...... Sorry, I need to think about＿something alone...... I'm sorry. I'll be in」"
msgstr "Kota「Solo estaba confundido, supongo......＿Eh, ehm...... Perdón, debo pensar solo＿en algo...... Perdón. Estaré en」"

msgid "Kota「touch......」"
msgstr "Kota「contacto......」"

msgid "Kota「（Not good...... Without realizing, my＿thoughts have become someone else's!＿Have I been adopting Takasu-senpai's）」"
msgstr "Kota「（Esto va mal...... ¡Sin darme cuenta,＿mis pensamientos ya son de otro! ¿Estaré＿adoptando de Takasu-senpai su）」"

msgid "Kota「（personality......?）」"
msgstr "Kota「（personalidad......?）」"

msgid "Sumire「Hmm. Still, when it's really happening＿to you, anyone would come to that＿conclusion. But first, we should focus」"
msgstr "Sumire「Mmm. Aun así, a cualquiera que le＿pase se le ocurriría eso. Pero primero＿deberíamos centrarnos」"

msgid "Sumire「on Takasu, living as Kota.」"
msgstr "Sumire「en Takasu, que vive como Kota.」"

msgid "Sumire「Takasu had amnesia to begin with, so＿his identity was already vague. That's＿why he's remembering Kota's」"
msgstr "Sumire「Takasu ya tenía amnesia, así que＿su identidad ya era difusa. Por eso,＿de Kota, está recordando」"

msgid "Sumire「memories as if they were his own.」"
msgstr "Sumire「los recuerdos como si fueran suyos.」"

msgid "Sumire「His heart is a blank slate, and his brain＿is filling in the blanks. One can infer＿that, sooner or later...... he'll become a」"
msgstr "Sumire「Su corazón está en blanco y su cerebro＿lo llena. Cabe inferir que, tarde＿o temprano...... será una」"

msgid "Sumire「perfect copy of Kota.」"
msgstr "Sumire「copia perfecta de Kota.」"

msgid "Kitamura「I get it now. Whether it's Kota's heart,＿mind, or god forbid his soul, his＿preserved sense of self ended up in」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ya entiendo. La identidad de Kota, sea＿su corazón, mente o, Dios no lo quiera,＿su alma, se conservó y acabó en」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu's body.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「el cuerpo de Takasu.」"

msgid "Kota「（......Oh, why am I concerned about＿Yasuko-san's dinner!? This is not good＿at all!! And I'm starting to feel...... Crap,）」"
msgstr "Kota「（......¡¿Por qué me preocupa la cena＿de Yasuko-san?! ¡¡Esto va muy mal!! Y＿empiezo a sentir...... Mierda,）」"

msgid "Kota「（I'm running out of time!!）」"
msgstr "Kota「（¡¡se me acaba el tiempo!!）」"

msgid "Kota「（There's no time! What do I do? What＿should I do!? Do I have some＿unfinished business!? Someone I need）」"
msgstr "Kota「（¡No hay tiempo! ¿Qué hago? ¡¿Qué＿debo hacer?! ¡¿Tengo algo pendiente?!＿¡¿Alguien a quien deba）」"

msgid "Kota「（to meet!? AAAAARRRRGGGGHHHH!!!!）」"
msgstr "Kota「（ver?! ¡¡¡¡AAAAARRRRGGGGHHHH!!!!）」"
